car.Car { Mass Float, Speed Float = 0.0, Name Text? = "a--b" }

A car, for the test of cesia doc on the block form of a struct.

  car.Car(1500).Speed --> 0.0
  car.Car(1500, Speed = 2.0).Moved(3.0) --> 6.0

  Speed  metres per second
(c Car) Moved(time Number)

How far it goes in this time.

  car.Car(1, 1.0).Moved(2.0) --> 2.0
